      "writtenOn": "2021-06-28T16:54:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is same reason as code \"waitForIdle\". ConnectivityService side SYNC call incrementCountOrThrow in binder thread, but AYNC call decrementCount in handler thread.  In Race-condition, ConnectivityService may SYNC call incrementCountOrThrow SAME_INTENTS times, but not AYNC call decrementCount yet. To pass this Race-condition, We should run SAME_INTENTS case Before DIFF_INTENTS, AND ensure DIFF_INTENTS \u003e\u003d SAME_INTENTS,  it is to ensure ConnectivityService has enough Free request slots for SAME_INTENTS when SYNC call incrementCountOrThrow\n\n###########\nI reviewed your patch.\nYou did waitForIdle after each registerNetworkCallback(networkRequest, same_pi);\nIf that, SAME_INTENTS can be whatever Before or After DIFF_INTENTS",
